The PC Overlay bugs, which were holding us back, have been found
and fixed by the PC team.  Our thanks to those who offered to help
in the chase.  There is no need anymore.

May 27th is the tentative date for the release of Patchlevel 8.  Pl8
will be the last official update of NetHack 3.0.  As we did with the
previous patches, Pl8 will be posted on comp.sources.games.  The full 
NetHack 3.0 (Pl8) code will be re-posted on comp.sources.games a
week or so later.

We would like to fix as many bugs as can still be found.  To conserve
time, please send bug reports directly to team.  To remind you: the 
team's email address is, nethack-bugs@linc.cis.upenn.edu.

For the Development Team,

-Izchak


